  "description": "Reactive SSDP device discovery for .NET. SsdpNotifier implements IObservable<DeviceInfo> and listens for multicast ssdp:alive and ssdp:byebye notifications, fetches full UPnP device details, and applies a caller-supplied Func<DeviceInfo, bool> filter before publishing. Supports active M-SEARCH, optional per-device deduplication, and in-memory device tracking via GetDevices().",
